## Demo Video

This video demonstrates the Fingerprint Recognition System in action. It shows how to use the web application, select fingerprint samples, perform fingerprint matching, view matching scores, and determine whether two fingerprints belong to the same person.

The video provides a practical demonstration of the system's main features and workflow.

[Watch the Demo Video](https://drive.google.com/file/d/13xRXOzRv_p1rXM426sUUA1aU9LM12dV7/view?usp=sharing)
